Fmprefs*tunneling.msgLineHelpText: Check to make a folder open into its parent's iconview.
Fmprefs*galleryMode.msgLineHelpText: Check to view image files as thumbnail icons.
Fmprefs*shelf.msgLineHelpText: Check to have the shelf in the iconview.
Fmprefs*preserveLayout.msgLineHelpText: Check so iconview opened in place uses parent's layout.
